@page "/roadmap"

<PageTitle>Roadmap</PageTitle>

<h1>Development roadmap</h1>

<div class="roadmap">
    <article class="active">
        <span>Milestone 1</span>
        <h2>Foundation</h2>
        <p>Service host, local panel, SQLite, process control, logs, and audit foundation.</p>
    </article>

    <article>
        <span>Milestone 2</span>
        <h2>Secure Palworld integration</h2>
        <p>Authentication, protected secrets, native REST API, graceful save, shutdown, metrics, and players.</p>
    </article>

    <article>
        <span>Milestone 3</span>
        <h2>Network safety</h2>
        <p>LAN lockdown, WAN publishing workflow, HTTPS, firewall rollback, and security auditing.</p>
    </article>

    <article>
        <span>Milestone 4+</span>
        <h2>Operations and ecosystem</h2>
        <p>Backups, updates, automation, mods, notifications, maps, and multi-instance management.</p>
    </article>
</div>
